{"seq":3,"slug":"combo-gesture","title":"连招与手势识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/feel/combo-gesture","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"连招与手势识别\">连招与手势识别</h1><p>&quot;下、右下、右 + 拳&quot;在格斗游戏里是一记波动拳；在玻璃屏上画一个 Z 是某 RPG 的火球术；同时按下三个键是一记和弦式终结技。这些都不是单个按键能表达的——它们是带时序、带方向、带容差的<strong>输入序列</strong>，需要一个专门的识别器把原始动作流解析成高阶指令。连招与手势识别是手感章里最接近&quot;模式匹配&quot;的一篇，它把玩家手上的一串动作翻译成游戏认得的一个 token，然后交给玩法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>序列识别的核心是：维护一个带时间戳的<strong>输入历史缓冲</strong>，在其上用某种匹配器持续尝试命中预定义的模式。模式可以是有序序列（搓招）、几何轨迹（手势）、或同时性约束（和弦）。识别器吃的是 <a href=\"../mapping/action-mapping\">动作映射</a> 交付的动作流，吐的是&quot;招式 token&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[动作流 + 时间戳] --&gt; B[滑动窗口历史缓冲]&#10;  B --&gt; C{识别器}&#10;  C --&gt;|有序序列| D[状态机/前缀匹配&lt;br/&gt;搓招 波动拳]&#10;  C --&gt;|几何轨迹| E[模板匹配 1-dollar&lt;br/&gt;画符手势]&#10;  C --&gt;|同时性| F[时间窗内并发判定&lt;br/&gt;和弦键]&#10;  D --&gt; G[招式 token]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[交付玩法/战斗系统]\">flowchart TD\n  A[动作流 + 时间戳] --&gt; B[滑动窗口历史缓冲]\n  B --&gt; C{识别器}\n  C --&gt;|有序序列| D[状态机/前缀匹配&lt;br/&gt;搓招 波动拳]\n  C --&gt;|几何轨迹| E[模板匹配 1-dollar&lt;br/&gt;画符手势]\n  C --&gt;|同时性| F[时间窗内并发判定&lt;br/&gt;和弦键]\n  D --&gt; G[招式 token]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[交付玩法/战斗系统]</pre><p>三类序列的识别手段不同，下表是选型依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序列类型</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>识别手段</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有序方向序列</td>\n<td>波动拳 236+P、升龙 623+P</td>\n<td>状态机 / 前缀匹配 + 输入缓冲</td>\n<td>每步间最大间隔、方向容差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几何手势</td>\n<td>触屏画 Z/圆/V</td>\n<td>模板匹配（$1 算法等）</td>\n<td>重采样点数、旋转/缩放不变性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同时按键（和弦）</td>\n<td>同时按 LT+RT、双键投技</td>\n<td>时间窗内并发计数</td>\n<td>同时性容差窗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节奏序列</td>\n<td>音游打点</td>\n<td>时间戳与判定线比对</td>\n<td>判定窗（perfect/good）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"有序序列-搓招与状态机\">有序序列：搓招与状态机</h2><p>格斗搓招是有序方向序列加按钮收尾的典型。识别它有两条主流路线。其一是<strong>状态机</strong>：每个招式是一条从中性态出发的路径，方向输入推进状态，走到终态且收尾按钮命中即触发；任一步超时或走错则回退。其二是<strong>输入历史扫描</strong>：把最近若干个带时间戳的方向/按钮存进环形缓冲，每帧从最新输入往回扫，看是否匹配某招式的逆序模式。</p>\n<p>两条路线都重度依赖容差设计，否则招式&quot;搓不出来&quot;。关键容差有三类：每步之间的<strong>最大时间间隔</strong>（太严则手快也搓不出，太松则误触发别的招）、方向的<strong>邻近容差</strong>（&quot;右下&quot;判定允许玩家偏一点到&quot;右&quot;或&quot;下&quot;，因为摇杆很难精确卡 45°）、以及与 <a href=\"input-buffering\">输入缓冲</a> 的耦合（收尾按钮可提前缓冲，等序列匹配完成立即兑现）。SOCD（同时反向输入）的清理规则也在这里生效（见 <a href=\"../mapping/action-mapping\">动作映射系统</a>）。优先级同样要设计——当一串输入同时满足&quot;波动拳&quot;和&quot;升龙&quot;时，按招式优先级表择一，避免误出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"几何手势-模板匹配\">几何手势：模板匹配</h2><p>触屏或体感画出的轨迹无法用按键序列表达，要用几何模板匹配。经典的轻量方案是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>单笔手势识别（</mtext><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 单笔手势识别（the</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单笔手势识别（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>1 recognizer）这一族算法：把玩家画的轨迹和每个模板都<strong>重采样</strong>成固定数量的等距点，做平移、缩放、旋转归一化，再算与各模板的点对点平均距离，取最近者为识别结果。其打分本质是最小化路径距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>gesture</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>template</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = 1 - \\frac{\\min_i d(\\text{gesture}, \\text{template}_i)}{\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sqrt{w^2 + h^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5754em;vertical-align:-1.1484em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1966em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9134em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8734em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1266em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gesture</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">template</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1484em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是重采样点的平均欧氏距离，分母是对角线长度做归一化。$1 算法的好处是无需训练、几十行可实现、对画的快慢与大小不敏感，非常适合&quot;画符放技能&quot;这类玩法。其核心步骤——重采样、旋转归一化、最近模板距离——可以精简成一小段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 1) 重采样成 N 个等距点；2) 平移到质心、缩放到单位框&#10;std::vector&lt;Point&gt; preprocess(std::vector&lt;Point&gt; pts, int N) {&#10;    pts = resample(pts, N);                 // 等弧长采样，消除画得快慢差异&#10;    Point c = centroid(pts);&#10;    for (auto&amp; p : pts) p -= c;             // 平移不变&#10;    float s = boundingDiagonal(pts);&#10;    for (auto&amp; p : pts) p /= s;             // 缩放不变（些微旋转留待打分时容忍）&#10;    return pts;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 取最近模板；分数越高越像&#10;Chosen recognize(const std::vector&lt;Point&gt;&amp; g, const std::vector&lt;Template&gt;&amp; tpls, float tol) {&#10;    int best = -1; float bestDist = 1e9f;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; (int)tpls.size(); ++i) {&#10;        float d = greedyCloudDistance(g, tpls[i].points);   // 点对点平均距离&#10;        if (d &lt; bestDist) { bestDist = d; best = i; }&#10;    }&#10;    return { best, 1.f - bestDist / (0.5f * kDiag) };        // 归一化分数&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1) 重采样成 N 个等距点；2) 平移到质心、缩放到单位框</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">preprocess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> N</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pts, N);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 // 等弧长采样，消除画得快慢差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Point c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> centroid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pts);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p : pts) p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             // 平移不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> boundingDiagonal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pts);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p : pts) p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             // 缩放不变（些微旋转留待打分时容忍）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pts;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark